TYPES.md §15: a later field read through a parenthesized `self` is E3010, as through `self` (parentheses are not nodes of their own).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record R {
  a: Int = (self).b
  b: Int = 1
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3010]  a/a.canon:4:12
  a default may read only fields declared before it; name an earlier field

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
